#: ui/app.slint:1833
msgid "Connect over IPv4 only"
msgstr "Alleen via IPv4 verbinden"


#: ui/app.slint:1837
msgid ""
"Can fix syncing that's slow to start or keeps timing out on some networks."
msgstr "Dit kan helpen als synchroniseren langzaam op gang komt of op sommige netwerken steeds vastloopt."


#: ui/app.slint:1847
msgid "Direction"
msgstr "Richting"


